      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-346467",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the area under the curve $y=(10-2x)^{2}$ over the interval $[2,4]$ using a right Riemann sum with step size $\u0394x=0.5.$The estimated area under the curve $y=(10-2x)^{2}$ over the interval $[2,4]$ is {{field-1}}.\nSince the function is strictly {{field-2}}\nin the interval,  the approximation is an\n{{field-3}}\nof the actual area."
